TI  - Unexplained alveolar hemorrhage associated with Ginkgo and ginseng use.
PG  - 170-2
LID - 10.1097/LBR.0000000000000150 [doi]
AB  - The author presents a case of diffuse alveolar hemorrhage in a woman consuming 
      Ginkgo biloba extract and ginseng. The patient had no illnesses or exposures that 
      would predispose to diffuse alveolar hemorrhage, and an extensive evaluation 
      revealed no etiology. The patient has had no further bleeding since discontinuing 
      Ginkgo biloba extract and ginseng 1 year ago.
