TI  - Pleomorphic adenoma of the trachea.
PG  - 230-3
LID - 10.1097/LBR.0000000000000076 [doi]
AB  - Endobronchial pleomorphic adenoma is an extremely rare condition. A 32-year-old 
      woman with exertional dyspnea and cough presented with a carinal mass on chest CT 
      scan. The tumor was successfully removed by rigid bronchoscopy using argon plasma 
      coagulation. Biopsy confirmed the diagnosis of pleomorphic adenoma.
